  "body": "Imagine summer holidays right at your doorstep, all year round. Your morning walk or swim at Takapuna Beach, cafés just around the corner, and lunch or dinner with friends whenever the mood takes you. \r\n\r\nWalk to the lifestyle you love, where you can enjoy more of the sunshine and beach culture and leave the weekends free for living, with no lawns to mow.\r\n\r\nWelcome to The Maison on the quiet end of Huron Street, where your beautifully presented, north-facing, two bedroom, two bathroom, 90sqm apartment offers sunny indoor-outdoor living, a generous deck and the freedom to live your best life every day.\r\n\r\nYour exclusive north-facing deck is a dedicated favourite spot for so many reasons - a sunny space to enjoy your morning coffee, a sheltered place to relax, read or work from home in the fresh air, or the perfect setting for a glass of wine with friends.\r\n\r\nWith two secure basement parks, an additional lockable storage unit, level street access, a lift and secure entry, this is apartment living with space and convenience. \r\n\r\nSimply lock up and leave when travel calls or enjoy the lifestyle you've always dreamed you could have, with more time to be you.\r\n\r\nOur motivated vendors are ready for their next move, creating an exciting opportunity to secure a prized position in one of Takapuna’s most desirable walkable beachside locations.\r\n\r\nZoned for Takapuna Primary, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Girls’ High School and Takapuna Grammar School, this location offers enduring appeal for those thinking ahead.\r\n\r\nMake this the summer you live the life your friends will envy.\r\n\r\nCall Shane or Jen now for your private viewing appointment.",
